This product includes software developed at IBM Research.

The agents in this repository are built on CUGA, an open-source agent runtime
from IBM Research (https://github.com/cuga-project/cuga-agent).

Each app integrates third-party data sources and APIs (e.g. Wikipedia, arXiv,
OpenStreetMap/Nominatim, CoinGecko, Alpha Vantage, Tavily). Those services are
owned by their respective providers and governed by their own terms of use and
licenses; this project does not redistribute their data.
